---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="See your demo — Fornax">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>See your site before you pay for anything</h1>
    <p class="tagline">We build your site before we ever ask you for money. This page explains the flow — there's no live intake form wired up yet (see the note below).</p>
  </section>

  <section class="demo-flow">
    <h2>How a demo works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h4>Tell us your business</h4>
        <p>Name, trade, service area and a phone or email — that's all we need to start.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h4>We build your site</h4>
        <p>Our design agent generates a site from your brand and trade, checked for accessibility and speed before it reaches you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h4>You see the site and the dashboard</h4>
        <p>A demo link shows your actual generated site plus a preview of the dashboard for your assigned tier: sample leads, CRM sync status, and your plan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <h4>Say yes and it goes live</h4>
        <p>Choose Managed or Offboard, pay, and your site is live in about a minute.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-preview">
    <h2>What the dashboard preview shows</h2>
    <div class="preview-card">
      <div class="preview-row">
        <span class="preview-label">Site</span>
        <span class="preview-value">Your generated site, live at a preview link</span>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-row">
        <span class="preview-label">Leads</span>
        <span class="preview-value">Sample lead activity so you can see the inbox in action</span>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-row">
        <span class="preview-label">CRM status</span>
        <span class="preview-value">Connected / not connected, shown for your assigned tier</span>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-row">
        <span class="preview-label">Plan</span>
        <span class="preview-value">Your assigned tier and price, ready to activate</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="preview-note">
      <strong>Placeholder — this preview mockup does not represent a real customer or real data.</strong>
      A working sandbox dashboard is planned but not built yet (Track H, not started — see <code>operations/COORDINATOR_STATE.md</code>).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="samples">
    <h2>Sample generated sites</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Illustrative examples of the site quality Fornax generates — these are not real customers.</p>
    <div class="samples-grid">
      <a href="/samples/hvac" class="sample-card">HVAC</a>
      <a href="/samples/plumbing" class="sample-card">Plumbing</a>
      <a href="/samples/cleaning" class="sample-card">Cleaning</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-footer">
    <h2>Want your own demo?</h2>
    <p>The live intake form isn't wired up on this draft site yet. Once outreach is approved, demo requests will flow through here.</p>
    <a href="/pricing" class="button button-secondary">See pricing</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .tagline {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .demo-flow, .dashboard-preview, .samples, .cta-footer {
    padding: 48px 20px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .demo-flow h2, .dashboard-preview h2, .samples h2, .cta-footer h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .step {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    line-height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #dc2626;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
  }

  .step h4 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .step p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .preview-card {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .preview-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .preview-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .preview-label {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #333;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .preview-value {
    color: #666;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .preview-note {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #999;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .preview-note code {
    background: #f5f5f5;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    margin: -16px 0 32px;
  }

  .samples-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .sample-card {
    padding: 16px 28px;
    border: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #333;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .sample-card:hover {
    border-color: #dc2626;
    color: #dc2626;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .cta-footer {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-footer p {
    color: #666;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .button {
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: white;
    color: #333;
    border: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .button-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #dc2626;
    color: #dc2626;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
